        "item_gHxeGT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "title": "Do you have instructional videos for the Bentley Trike?",
            "content": "<p>We know how special the celebration is, so we make assembly effortless. Every trike comes with step-by-step video guides, safety tips, and stage-by-stage walkthroughs to ensure you're ready to roll right out of the box.</p><p>Watch our full library anytime here: <a href=\"/pages/bentley-trike-instructional-videos\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bentley Trike Instructional Videos\"><strong>Bentley Trike Instructional Videos</strong></a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_D698pW": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "title": "Can it be passed down or refreshed as they grow?",
            "content": "<p>Designed to last well beyond the early years, the Bentley Trike is built for everyday adventure and future siblings alike. If you ever need a fresh set of wheels, hardware, or replacement pieces, you can easily restore your trike with <a href=\"/products/bentley-trike-spare-parts\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bentley Trike Spare Parts\">official Bentley spare parts here</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_eQD9zq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "title": "How does the official Bentley warranty protect our gift?",
            "content": "<p>A milestone gift should come with lasting confidence. Every trike purchased directly through our official store includes a comprehensive <strong>2-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p><p>If you ever need assistance or dedicated support, simply submit your order details and our care team will resolve it promptly.</p><p><em>Please note : Warranty coverage applies exclusively to purchases made directly from us. If purchased elsewhere, kindly reach out to the original retailer for assistance</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
